{"words": [{"text": "وَقَالَتِ", "translation": "And said"}, {"text": "ٱلْيَهُودُ", "translation": "the Jews"}, {"text": "لَيْسَتِ", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ", "translation": "the Christians"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "(are) on"}, {"text": "شَىْءٍۢ", "translation": "anything"}, {"text": "وَقَالَتِ", "translation": "and said"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ", "translation": "the Christians"}, {"text": "لَيْسَتِ", "translation": "Not"}, {"text": "ٱلْيَهُودُ", "translation": "the Jews"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "(are) on"}, {"text": "شَىْءٍۢ", "translation": "anything"}, {"text": "وَهُمْ", "translation": "although they"}, {"text": "يَتْلُونَ", "translation": "recite"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ ۗ", "translation": "the Book"}, {"text": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "Like that"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "said"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "(do) not"}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "know"}, {"text": "مِثْلَ", "translation": "similar"}, {"text": "قَوْلِهِمْ ۚ", "translation": "their saying"}, {"text": "فَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "[So] Allah"}, {"text": "يَحْكُمُ", "translation": "will judge"}, {"text": "بَيْنَهُمْ", "translation": "between them"}, {"text": "يَوْمَ", "translation": "(on the) Day"}, {"text": "ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ", "translation": "(of) Resurrection"}, {"text": "فِيمَا", "translation": "in what"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "they were"}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "translation": "[in it]"}, {"text": "يَخْتَلِفُونَ", "translation": "differing"}], "sahih": "The Jews say, \"The Christians have nothing [true] to stand on,\" and the Christians say, \"The Jews have nothing to stand on,\" although they [both] recite the Scripture. Thus do those who know not [i.e., the polytheists] speak the same as their words. But Allāh will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning that over which they used to differ."}